Spec: Shared control frame codec

Purpose:
  Encode and decode exact bounded control payloads over caller-owned streams.

Owns:
  ./FrameCodec.cs

Must:
  Use a four-byte unsigned little-endian length, accepting `1` to `65536` payload bytes.
  Return clean EOF only before a header and reject truncated headers/bodies without over-limit allocation.
  Preserve cancellation on reads, writes and flushes.
